   709	  - For P ∈ Λ_ℓ(g), P ≡ (b/g₁)(g₀, g₁) (mod ℓ). Hence ⟨c, v(P)⟩ ≡ (b/g₁)^{d−1}R_c(g₀, g₁) (mod ℓ).
