\]
The enlarged interval consequently has length divided by \(q\) bounded by \(O(M/V)\). DS applies in exactly its stated range, including non-reduced residues. Dropping the coprimality restrictions on the fibre only enlarges the count.

The \(\ell\)-average is legitimate in Step 7. Before invoking BDH_fam, replace all \(V_\ell\)-dependent geometric factors by uniform envelopes; \(V_{\max}/V_{\min}\) is bounded. The associated density comparisons cost at most polylogarithms. Thus \(\#\mathcal P_\ell\), \(U_\ell\), and the kernel factor do not introduce an uncontrolled weight into class (C).

